OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 600 jobs lost as Kanes
OL,4,AFoods folds
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 600 people have lost their
OL,7,Fjobs after a Worcestershire-based food
OL,8,Fcompany went into administration.
OL,10,FKanes Food Limited makes prepared
OL,11,Fmeals, including pre-packaged salads,
OL,12,Fstir-fry products and sauces, from a
OL,13,Fsite in Evesham, and supplies several
OL,14,Fmajor UK supermarkets.
OL,16,FIt employed 662 people and was one of
OL,17,Fthe largest employers in its
OL,18,Fconstituency, said Nigel Huddleston,
OL,19,FConservative MP for Droitwich and
OL,20,FEvesham, who also described it as "a
OL,21,Fmajor part of the local economy".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
