OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 600 jobs lost as Kanes
OL,4,AFoods folds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement released by the joint
OL,7,Fadministrators said the company had
OL,8,Ffaced "significant financial and
OL,9,Foperational challenges over the last
OL,10,Ffew years".
